            <li>[CRM 2014] ISO 21127:2014. Information and
            documentation – A reference ontology for the interchange of
            cultural heritage information. <a
            href="https://www.iso.org/standard/57832.html">Reference</a></li>
            <li>[CRM 2014] Oldman, Dominic and CRM Labs (2014). The
            CIDOC Conceptual Reference Model (CIDOC-CRM): Primer. <a
