            <li>[EDM 2017] Definition of the Europeana Data Model
            v5.2.8. (2017). Europeana Foundation. <a
            href="https://pro.europeana.eu/files/Europeana_Professional/Share_your_data/Technical_requirements/EDM_Documentation//EDM_Definition_v5.2.8_102017.pdf">PDF</a></li>
            <li>[IFLA-FRBRoo] Bekiari, Chryssoula; Doerr, Martin; Le
            Boeuf, Patrick; Riva, Pat (2015). Definition of FRBRoo: A
            Conceptual Model for Bibliographic Information in
            Object-Oriented Formalism. <a
